.IX Title "Koha::Object::JSONFields 3pm"
.TH Koha::Object::JSONFields 3pm "2026-06-25" "perl v5.32.1" "User Contributed Perl Documentation"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH "NAME"
Koha::Object::JSONFields \- Class that adds JSON field manipulation helper methods
for Koha::Object\-derived classes
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
.Vb 4
\&    use base qw(Koha::Object Koha::Object::JSONFields);
\&    my $object = Koha::Object\->new({ property1 => $property1, property2 => $property2, etc... } );
\&    my $field_name_hashref = $object\->decode_json_field({ field => \*(Aqfield_name\*(Aq });
\&    $object\->encode_json_field({ field => \*(Aqfield_name\*(Aq, data => $data });
.Ve
.SH "API"
.IX Header "API"
.SS "Class methods"
.IX Subsection "Class methods"
\fIdecode_json_field\fR
.IX Subsection "decode_json_field"
.PP
.Vb 1
\&    my $hashref = $object\->decode_json_field({ field => \*(Aqfield_name\*(Aq });
.Ve
.PP
Returns a data structure representing the JSON-decoded value of field \fIfield_name\fR.
.PP
\fIset_encoded_json_field\fR
.IX Subsection "set_encoded_json_field"
.PP
.Vb 5
\&    $object\->set_encoded_json_field(
\&        {   data  => $data,
\&            field => \*(Aqfield_name\*(Aq,
\&        }
\&    );
.Ve
.PP
Sets a \s-1JSON\s0 string encoded representation of \fI\f(CI$data\fI\fR into the object's \fIfield_name\fR
attribute.
.SS "Internal methods"
.IX Subsection "Internal methods"
\fI_json\fR
.IX Subsection "_json"
.PP
.Vb 1
\&    my $JSON_object = $self\->_json;
.Ve
.PP
Returns a \s-1JSON\s0 object with utf8 disabled. Encoding to \s-1UTF\-8\s0 should be
done later.
.SH "AUTHOR"
.IX Header "AUTHOR"
Tomas Cohen Arazi, <tomascohen@theke.io>
